Package: rpbnb
Type: Package
Title: Random-Parameter Bivariate Negative Binomial Regression
Version: 0.4.4
Authors@R: person("Zhenyu", "Wang", email = "wonstran@hotmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Author: Zhenyu Wang [aut, cre]
Maintainer: Zhenyu Wang <wonstran@hotmail.com>
Description: Maximum-likelihood estimation of bivariate negative binomial
    (NB2) regression models with Famoye/Sarmanov or discrete-copula
    (Frank, Gaussian, or Clayton) dependence, and maximum-simulated-likelihood
    estimation of a bivariate random-parameter negative binomial model under
    either dependence structure, with a random-coefficient data simulator,
    diagnostics, and standard model methods. Two estimation engines are
    provided: an OpenMP/Rcpp maximum-simulated-likelihood engine and a TMB
    automatic-differentiation engine that additionally offers a Laplace
    approximation, with a common front end.
